> SELECT title, year FROM books
title                | year
---------------------+-----
Things Fall Apart    | 1958
Kindred              | 1979
Kitchen              | 1988
Parable of the Sower | 1993
Sula                 | 1973
Beloved              | 1987

> SELECT title, year FROM books ORDER BY year DESC
title                | year
---------------------+-----
Parable of the Sower | 1993
Kitchen              | 1988
Beloved              | 1987
Kindred              | 1979
Sula                 | 1973
Things Fall Apart    | 1958

> SELECT title, author FROM books ORDER BY title LIMIT 3
title   | author
--------+------------------
Beloved | Toni Morrison
Kindred | Octavia E. Butler
Kitchen | Banana Yoshimoto

> SELECT * FROM books WHERE id = 2
id | title   | author            | year | copies | isbn
---+---------+-------------------+------+--------+--------------
2  | Kindred | Octavia E. Butler | 1979 | 0      | 9780807083697

